15::
1:
The object is declared\n
in a read only module\n
and cannot be modified.
2:
The object is declared\n
in a view only module\n
and cannot be modified.
3:
Name not allowed! It must\n
begin with a letter and no\n
reserved words are allowed.
4:
Execution direction cannot\n
be changed within a\n
complex instruction.
5:
Not allowed to change\n
execution direction\n
within this routine.
6:
RAPID syntax error(s).\n
Error(s) in program.
7:
Cannot execute past first\n
instruction in a block\n
or a routine.
8:
Cannot set PP to required\n
position. Try with another\n
position.
9:
The object is declared in a\n
noview module and can't be\n
changed, saved or printed.
10:
Routine declared in a \n
noview module. The routine\n
content cannot be shown.
11:
Local datatype not defined \n
